WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
Friends, what an incredible adventure!

00:02.800 --> 00:08.800
Today we discovered that when the Apollo 11 astronauts reached the Moon in 1969,

00:08.800 --> 00:12.600
they left behind very special objects that are still there today.

00:12.600 --> 00:17.500
Eagle’s base, a laser mirror, and a moonquake detector.

00:17.500 --> 00:23.000
Each one has a story to tell and helps us understand how we explore the Moon.

00:23.000 --> 00:29.500
Even though many years have passed, these objects are part of our history, and we must never forget them.

00:29.500 --> 00:35.000
We will never forget what you left behind on the Moon!
